## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen3.8-27B
- **Short description:** Alibaba Qwen dense 27B vision-language open-weights (Apache-2.0), image/video understanding with 262K native (extensible to 1M YaRN).
- **Provider / access:** Open weights Hugging Face `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`; API varies by host (no Zen Free ID)
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 (Qwen3.8 generation) — exact date not verified
- **IDs:** `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B` (open weights)
- **Context window:** 262,144 native (extensible to 1M with YaRN) — per meta.json
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in; text out (thinking on by default)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-25):** Open weights self-host free; no Zen Free ID, API pricing varies
- **Architecture:** dense 27B, open-weights Apache-2.0

